{"seq":3,"slug":"screening-diagnostic","title":"筛查与诊断试验评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/screening-diagnostic","wordCount":2009,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"筛查与诊断试验评价\">筛查与诊断试验评价</h1><p>一项血液筛查广告说「准确率 99%」，听起来无懈可击。但若这病在人群中只有万分之一，那么在所有「阳性」的人里，绝大多数其实是健康的虚惊——同一个「99% 准确」的试验，用在高危人群和普通人群上，意义天差地别。诊断与筛查试验的评价，是流行病学中最反直觉、也最贴近临床与公共卫生决策的一块。它把概率的语言落到「这张化验单到底意味着什么」，并揭示筛查这件「看似有益无害」的事背后，藏着多少系统性的认知陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>评价一个二分类试验，先要把「试验结果」与「真实状态」交叉成四格表。真实状态由金标准（gold standard）判定，试验结果分阳性、阴性。四种组合是：真阳性 TP、假阳性 FP、真阴性 TN、假阴性 FN。所有评价指标都是从这张四格表里算出来的不同比值，理解它们「分母是谁」是不被绕晕的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[四格表] --&gt; B[沿真实状态看&lt;br/&gt;固有属性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[沿试验结果看&lt;br/&gt;随患病率变]&#10;    B --&gt; D[灵敏度&lt;br/&gt;病人中检出的比例]&#10;    B --&gt; E[特异度&lt;br/&gt;健康者中排除的比例]&#10;    C --&gt; F[阳性预测值&lt;br/&gt;阳性中真病的比例]&#10;    C --&gt; G[阴性预测值&lt;br/&gt;阴性中真健康的比例]\">flowchart TD\n    A[四格表] --&gt; B[沿真实状态看&lt;br/&gt;固有属性]\n    A --&gt; C[沿试验结果看&lt;br/&gt;随患病率变]\n    B --&gt; D[灵敏度&lt;br/&gt;病人中检出的比例]\n    B --&gt; E[特异度&lt;br/&gt;健康者中排除的比例]\n    C --&gt; F[阳性预测值&lt;br/&gt;阳性中真病的比例]\n    C --&gt; G[阴性预测值&lt;br/&gt;阴性中真健康的比例]</pre><p>下表给出完整四格表与核心指标的算式。请特别注意：灵敏度、特异度的分母在「真实状态」那一侧（按列），预测值的分母在「试验结果」那一侧（按行）——这个朝向之差，正是后面所有反直觉结论的根源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>分母方向</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灵敏度 Se</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP/(TP+FN)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>真病人（列）</td>\n<td>病人被检出的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特异度 Sp</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TN/(TN+FP)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>真健康（列）</td>\n<td>健康者被排除的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阳性预测值 PPV</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP/(TP+FP)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>阳性者（行）</td>\n<td>阳性中真病的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴性预测值 NPV</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TN/(TN+FN)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>阴性者（行）</td>\n<td>阴性中真健康的比例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"灵敏度-特异度与权衡\">灵敏度、特异度与权衡</h2><p>灵敏度与特异度是试验的「固有属性」——它们由试验本身的性能决定，不随人群患病率改变（这一点常被误解，详见下节）。高灵敏度的试验「漏诊少」，适合用于不能放过任何病例的场景，如献血筛查传染病——宁可错杀，不可放过。高特异度的试验「误诊少」，适合用于确诊环节，避免给健康人贴上疾病标签。</p>\n<p>二者通常此消彼长，矛盾的焦点是「阳性/阴性的判定阈值」（cutoff）。把阈值定低，更多人被判阳性，灵敏度升高但特异度下降；阈值定高则反之。ROC 曲线（受试者工作特征曲线）正是把所有可能阈值下的「灵敏度 vs 1−特异度」连成一线，曲线下面积 AUC 综合衡量试验区分病人与健康者的总体能力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AUC=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 等于瞎猜、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AUC=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 完美。临床实践里阈值不是纯统计选择，而要权衡漏诊与误诊各自的代价——漏诊一个早期可治的癌症，与误诊一个良性结节带来的过度活检，孰轻孰重，是价值判断而非数学问题。这种权衡思维与 <a href=\"effect-modification\">效应修饰与交互</a> 中「绝对代价驱动决策」的逻辑相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测值与患病率-最反直觉的一环\">预测值与患病率：最反直觉的一环</h2><p>灵敏度和特异度告诉你「试验有多好」，但临床医生真正想知道的是「这张阳性化验单，病人真患病的概率是多少」——这是阳性预测值 PPV，它致命地依赖于患病率。同一个灵敏度 99%、特异度 99% 的优秀试验，用贝叶斯公式可算出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PPV = \\dfrac{Se \\times P}{Se \\times P + (1-Sp) \\times (1-P)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是患病率（先验概率）。下表用这个公式展示同一试验在不同患病率下 PPV 的剧变，这是整节最该记住的一张表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>患病率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>特异度</th>\n<th>阳性预测值 PPV</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.01%</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>约 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>92%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>患病率万分之一时，即便试验近乎完美，阳性者里真正患病的也只有约 1%——其余 99% 是假阳性的虚惊。这就是为什么对低患病率人群做大规模筛查要极其谨慎：海量假阳性会带来焦虑、过度检查与医疗资源挤兑。它也解释了「先用病史和症状提高检验前概率，再做检查」的临床智慧——把患病率从万分之一提到百分之一，PPV 就从 1% 跃到 50%。这一逻辑与 <a href=\"../foundations/disease-frequency\">疾病频率测量</a> 中患病率的地位、以及贝叶斯更新的思想直接相连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"似然比与序贯检验\">似然比与序贯检验</h2><p>预测值虽实用，却随患病率变动，不便在不同人群间迁移。似然比（likelihood ratio, LR）提供了一个既携带试验性能、又便于做概率更新的量。阳性似然比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR^{+} = \\dfrac{Se}{1-Sp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示「阳性结果在病人中出现的概率，是其在健康者中出现概率的几倍」；阴性似然比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR^{-} = \\dfrac{1-Se}{Sp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 同理。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR^{+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越小，试验的判别力越强。</p>\n<p>似然比的妙处在于可直接做序贯更新：检验后比值 = 检验前比值 × 似然比。把患病率换算成比值（odds），乘以似然比，再换回概率，就得到了检验后概率——这是循证医学床旁推理的标准工具，也让多个检查可以一步步叠加更新概率。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR^{+}&gt;10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8104em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LR^{-}&lt;0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8104em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 通常被视为对诊断有决定性影响。似然比把诊断思维形式化为概率更新，与 <a href=\"../foundations/causal-inference\">因果推断框架</a> 中反事实和概率推理的精神同源，也是 <a href=\"../applications/surveillance-evidence\">监测与循证决策</a> 倡导的量化决策的微观体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"筛查的特殊陷阱\">筛查的特殊陷阱</h2><p>把诊断试验用于「在无症状人群中提前发现疾病」就是筛查，它额外背负几类专属偏倚，会系统性地夸大筛查的「疗效」。领先时间偏倚（lead-time bias）：筛查只是把诊断提前，看似「确诊后存活更久」，实则只是提早知道、生存终点未变。长度偏倚（length bias）：进展慢的惰性肿瘤窗口期长，更容易被周期性筛查逮到，于是筛查发现的病例天然偏向「本来预后就好」的那批。过度诊断（overdiagnosis）是长度偏倚的极端——查出一些终生不会引起症状、不会致死的「疾病」，治疗它们只带来伤害而无收益。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏倚</th>\n<th>机理</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>领先时间</td>\n<td>诊断提前但终点不变</td>\n<td>高估生存获益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度偏倚</td>\n<td>惰性病例更易被筛中</td>\n<td>高估筛查人群预后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度诊断</td>\n<td>查出不会发病的「病」</td>\n<td>过度治疗、净伤害</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正因这些陷阱，「筛查能否真正降低疾病死亡率」必须由随机对照试验回答，而非看「筛查发现者活得更久」这类被偏倚污染的指标。评价一个筛查项目是否值得推行，要综合疾病负担、试验性能、患病率（决定 PPV）、确诊与治疗的可及性，以及过度诊断的代价——这是一个典型的多因素循证决策，归属 <a href=\"../applications/surveillance-evidence\">监测与循证决策</a> 的判断框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>诊断评价从「试验结果 × 真实状态」四格表出发；灵敏度/特异度按列（真实状态），预测值按行（试验结果）。</li>\n<li>灵敏度、特异度是试验固有属性，不随患病率变；二者随判定阈值此消彼长，ROC/AUC 综合衡量判别力。</li>\n<li>阳性预测值由贝叶斯公式严重依赖患病率：完美试验用于低患病率人群，阳性者多为假阳性虚惊。</li>\n<li>似然比携带试验性能且可做序贯概率更新（检验后比值 = 检验前比值 × 似然比），是床旁循证推理工具。</li>\n<li>筛查额外受领先时间、长度偏倚、过度诊断之害，真实获益须靠 RCT 的死亡率终点判定，是多因素循证决策。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"筛查与诊断试验评价","id":"筛查与诊断试验评价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"灵敏度、特异度与权衡","id":"灵敏度-特异度与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"预测值与患病率：最反直觉的一环","id":"预测值与患病率-最反直觉的一环"},{"level":2,"text":"似然比与序贯检验","id":"似然比与序贯检验"},{"level":2,"text":"筛查的特殊陷阱","id":"筛查的特殊陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"效应修饰与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/effect-modification"},"next":{"title":"传染病流行病学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/applications/infectious-disease-epi"}}